This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

It does NOT cover, and this repository does not redistribute:

  * Medical imaging datasets. Each carries its own terms, several of which
    forbid redistribution. CHAOS, for example, is CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
    (non-commercial, share-alike), and CAMUS requires that Leclerc et al.,
    IEEE TMI 38(9):2198-2210, 2019 be cited for any use. See
    configs/datasets.yaml and configs/sources.yaml for the source and terms of
    every dataset used, and data/provenance.json (generated at download time)
    for exactly which files were retrieved.

  * Model weights. SAM and MedSAM checkpoints are obtained from their
    publishers under their own licences; SAM 3 weights are gated under Meta's
    SAM licence.

  * The paper being reproduced. Huang et al., "Segment anything model for
    medical images?", Medical Image Analysis 92 (2024) 103061, is copyright
    Elsevier and is deliberately excluded from version control.
